<title>COLOMBIA: Colombia's Banco Popular Q1 net up 19.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Colombia's Banco Popular Q1 net up 19.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombia's  Banco Popular, part of the Luis Carlos Sarmiento financial empire, posted the following first quarter results, the banking superintendency said Wednesday:</p>
<p>		  Q1 1997			Q1 1996</p>
<p>Net profits	8.5 billion	   7.1 billion</p>
<p>Total assets 1.61 trillion	 1.5 trillion</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Colombian pesos.</p>
<p>((Javier Mozzo, Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944))</p>
</text>
